माययापहृतज्ञाना आसुरं भावमाश्रिता: ॥ १५ ॥\"}}]}]]]}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"2202-verse_text,2202-verse_text\",{\"className\":\"av-verse_text\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-center em-leading-5 em-text-xl font-bold em-mb-4 hidden\",\"children\":\"Verse text\"}],[[\"$\",\"$L2b\",\"child-2204\",{\"child\":\"$23:props:children:0:props:children:props:page:child_items:1:children:0\",\"hasId\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"em-mb-4 em-leading-8 em-text-base text-center italic\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"na māṁ duṣkṛtino mūḍhāḥ
